 pfwd  devbox * connected                                     auto: on   ? help
------------+------------------------------------------------------+------------
  STATE   RE| Keys                                                 |FFIC
> * fwd   :5|                                                      |K/s ^1.0K/s
  o pause :8| up down  j k move                                    |
  * fwd   :8| g G          first, last                             |^0
  ----------| enter  f     forward the port, or stop it            |----------
  -       :6| F            forward to another local port           |
  -       :9| x            stop the forward                        |
            | o            open in the browser                     |
            | y            copy the URL                            |
            | p            pin: remember the forward next time     |
            | a            turn auto-forward on or off             |
            | /            filter by port, process or label        |
            | h            show or hide ignored ports              |
            | L            event log                               |
            | r            expose a local port on the server       |
            | d            start or stop a SOCKS proxy (1080)      |
            | c            reconnect now                           |
            | x            stop retrying, while reconnecting       |
            | ?  esc       close this help                         |
- 1 ignored | q  ctrl+c    quit                                    |------------
 + Forwarded+------------------------------------------------------+
 enter stop  o open  y copy  p pin  a auto  / filter  L log  ? help  q quit
